> References

- [Deng et al. (2019), ArcFace](https://arxiv.org/abs/1801.07698).
- [Wang et al. (2018), CosFace](https://arxiv.org/abs/1801.09414).
- [Liu et al. (2017), SphereFace](https://arxiv.org/abs/1704.08063).
